OL,3,GNEWSAFire reaches home after spreading
OL,4,Athrough vehicles
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have put out a fire that
OL,7,Fspread through several vehicles before
OL,8,Freaching a home on the Isle of Wight.
OL,10,FCrews from across the island were sent
OL,11,Fto the fire after it broke out at about
OL,12,F03:00 BST on Kingston Road, East Cowes.
OL,14,FHampshire & Isle of Wight Fire & Rescue
OL,15,FService advised residents to keep doors
OL,16,Fand windows closed due to the amount of
OL,17,Fsmoke lingering in the area.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
