OL,3,GNEWSAFire reaches home after spreading
OL,4,Athrough vehicles
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fire service said firefighters had
OL,7,Fdampened down hotspots and checked over
OL,8,Fthe home affected. It said the fire is
OL,9,Fbelieved to have been caused by an
OL,10,Fengine fault in one of the vehicles.
